--- binary named ls acts as ls ---
ls
one.txt
two.txt
rc=0
--- unknown flag on a symlinked utility reports an error, not a crash ---
kosh: 1:6: error: tail: Unknown flag '--bogus'.
     1 |  tail --bogus
       |       ^~~~~~~
note: Use `--` before an operand that begins with a dash.
rc=1
--- a symlinked utility reports the kosh version on --version ---
1
== a symlink was installed for head:
head-linked
== a symlinked head routes its own -c flag to the utility:
abc
== a symlinked ls routes -A to ls (count of the dot file):
1
